<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Create imperial megaturrets: Kontarion, Onager and Palintone, as well as their ammunition.-->
  <VFED_ImperialDefenses.description>创建帝国巨型炮塔：Kontarion、Onager 和 Palintone，以及它们的弹药。</VFED_ImperialDefenses.description>
  <VFED_ImperialDefenses.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->fortress engineering-->
    <li>subject-&gt;要塞工程</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->engineered the mightiest defenses, deterring would-be conquerors with mere rumors of their power-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;设计了最强大的防御，仅靠谣言威慑潜在的征服者</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->crafted turrets that combined ancient design principles with futuristic weaponry-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精心制作的炮塔将古代设计原理与未来武器相结合</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->ensured the empire's borders were impregnable, standing as a testament to imperial ingenuity-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;确保帝国的边界坚不可摧，这是帝国独创性的证明</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->redefining the art of defense-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;重新定义防御艺术</li>
  </VFED_ImperialDefenses.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: imperial defenses-->
  <VFED_ImperialDefenses.label>帝国防御</VFED_ImperialDefenses.label>
  <!--EN: Craft powerful imperial mortar shells, such as shrapnel, armor piercing and cluster.-->
  <VFED_ImperialWarSolutions.description>制作强大的帝国迫击炮弹，例如弹片、穿甲弹和集束弹。</VFED_ImperialWarSolutions.description>
  <VFED_ImperialWarSolutions.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->advanced ordnance-->
    <li>subject-&gt;先进军械</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->innovated artillery ammunition that turned battlefields to their advantage with a single salvo-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;创新的火炮弹药，只需一次齐射即可将战场变为优势</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->developed shells that could pierce the toughest armors or scatter enemies with relentless shrapnel-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开发了炮弹，可以刺穿最坚韧的盔甲或用无情的弹片驱散敌人</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->transformed the empire's artillery into a force capable of dictating the terms of engagement-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将帝国的炮兵转变为一支能够决定交战条件的力量</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->mastering the science of destruction-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;掌握破坏科学</li>
  </VFED_ImperialWarSolutions.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: imperial war solutions-->
  <VFED_ImperialWarSolutions.label>帝国战争解决方案</VFED_ImperialWarSolutions.label>
  <!--EN: Build advanced explosive traps with remote detonation mechanism.-->
  <VFED_RemoteDemolition.description>利用远程引爆机制构建高级爆炸陷阱。</VFED_RemoteDemolition.description>
  <VFED_RemoteDemolition.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->tactical demolitions-->
    <li>subject-&gt;战术拆除</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->pioneered the use of remotely controlled explosives, changing the dynamics of siege warfare-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;率先使用遥控炸药，改变了攻城战的动态</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->crafted traps that could be detonated at the perfect moment, creating chaos among enemy ranks-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精心设计的陷阱可以在完美的时刻引爆，在敌人队伍中制造混乱</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->turned the battlefield into a meticulously controlled environment, where every step could be the last-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将战场变成了一个精心控制的环境，每一步都可能是最后一步</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->elevating the element of surprise to an art form-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;将惊喜元素提升为一种艺术形式</li>
  </VFED_RemoteDemolition.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: imperial war solutions-->
  <VFED_RemoteDemolition.label>帝国战争解决方案</VFED_RemoteDemolition.label>
</LanguageData>
